# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .dockerignore
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Docker build context exclusion rules
# * Function     : Keeps the build context small and deterministic. The frozen
# *                COBOL corpus in app/ is REFERENCE material for the migration
# *                and is never needed inside the runtime image, so it is
# *                excluded here even though it must never be deleted from the
# *                repository. No legacy equivalent exists.
